title: Shell command put on the clipboard
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: suspicious-clipboard
attack: T1204.004
description: The page wrote a shell command to the clipboard without other ClickFix traits
  (developer docs with copy buttons do this too).
---
// A shell command on the clipboard with none of the ClickFix signs: no ClickFix trait
// and no paste-into-Run steps (developer docs with copy buttons do this).
clipboard_commands
| where not(exists(clickfix_commands)) and not(exists(run_dialog_pages))
| project command = substring(text, 0, 1000), trait, api, frame_url
